  </li>
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>It acts as proof of delivery and is necessary for any claims if damage occurs during transit</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>
<p>Crucially, you must highlight the importance of <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. Standard transit coverage often has caps or deductibles that leave you vulnerable to significant financial loss if the bike is damaged. By opting for insurance that covers 100% of the declared market value of your motorcycle, you eliminate out-of-pocket expenses for repairs.</p>
<p>This comprehensive coverage ensures that if the bike suffers any damage due to accidents, weather, or handling errors during the journey, the insurer compensates you fully based on the pre-declared value. Do not compromise on this aspect, as it provides complete financial peace of mind throughout the transportation process.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


